# Internal working documents.
# AI planning notes and improvement drafts are working material: they carry
# developer machine paths and add exposure surface without helping anyone who
# clones this repository. Published specs live in docs/specs/.
docs/plans/
docs/superpowers/
docs/active/
docs/complete/
IMPROVEMENT_PLAN.md

# Test artifacts.
# Playwright's storageState holds a signed session token, and the failure
# artifacts contain screenshots and DOM dumps of real accounts and filenames.
# None of it belongs in a public repository.
tests/e2e/playwright/.auth/
tests/e2e/test-results/
tests/e2e/playwright-report/
tests/e2e/blob-report/
playwright/.cache/

